~C. Ignore context when explaining the word#This choice reflects a misconception about word meaning or word origin. Use context and meaning to revise.
=D. Choose the derived form that fits the sentence role#Correct. This choice uses vocabulary knowledge to make the speech clearer, more precise, and appropriate for the audience.
}
